## 3. Step-by-Step Radiology Workflow

| Step | Stage | What Happens | Main Role |
| ---- | ----- | ------------ | --------- |
| 1 | Order received | Order on radiology workbench. | System |
| 2 | Billing gate (if required) | Pay-now or bill-later. | Cashier / System |
| 3 | Scheduling / assignment | Assign modality, room, equipment. | Radiology clerk |
| 4 | Study start | Patient scanned; study record created. | Radiographer |
| 5 | Asset capture | Images uploaded; PACS sync if configured. | Radiographer / System |
| 6 | Report draft | Radiologist drafts report. | Radiologist |
| 7 | Finalization / attestation | Final report released. | Radiologist |
| 8 | Addendum (if needed) | Corrected or supplemental report. | Radiologist |

---

## 4. Backend Workbench Contract

Use `/api/v1/radiology/*` workspace routes as canonical. Order pipeline: assign â' start â' complete â' cancel; study workflow with asset upload and PACS; result draft â' finalize â' attestation â' addendum.

